        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by the Virgo Cloth Passive, @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Virgo — Nearest to God]</p><p><strong>Your eyes are closed.</strong> The <strong>blinded</strong> condition applies for as long as they are, and lifts the moment you open them.</p><p>Increase this effect's value by 1 at the end of each of your turns, to a maximum of 5 (7 on a day Virgo is ascendant).</p><p>While your eyes are closed you gain the value as a <strong>status bonus to your Technique DCs and to unarmed Strike damage</strong>, and from 7th level your Sixth Sense becomes a <strong>precise sense out to 30 feet</strong>, letting you fight blind.</p><hr /><h3>Spending the stacks</h3><p>Toggle <strong>Eyes Open</strong> on this effect. That immediately removes the blindness and arms the empowerment on your next Technique or unarmed Strike:</p><ul><li><strong>+2 damage dice per stack</strong>, and</li><li><strong>+1 to the DC per 2 stacks</strong> &mdash; the guide writes this as a &minus;1 circumstance penalty per 2 stacks to the target's save, which is the same number from the other side, and this is the side Foundry can actually roll.</li></ul><p><strong>Delete this effect once you have taken that roll.</strong> That is the spend; the stacks reset to 0.</p><p>Your eyes open automatically, spending nothing, if you are knocked unconscious &mdash; delete the effect without toggling.</p>"
        },
